{
  "info": {
    "name": "Coderr Day 12 - Order Status and Deletion",
    "description": "Creates four fictional accounts, one offer and two test orders. Supply a local test-only staff_token temporarily before the run, then clear it and revoke it. Never export credentials. Deletes only the new disposable order and keeps the control order.",
